```
The header title and subtitle will be rendered in the header, next to the logo. The action with the highest priority (lowest number) will be used as the
primary action, others will shown in the popover menu on demand. A `OCPAppFrameworkHttpTemplateSimpleMenuAction` will be a link with an icon added to the menu. App
