If you want your widget content to be accessible with the dashboard API for Nextcloud clients,
it must implement the `OCPDashboardIAPIWidget` interface rather than `OCPDashboardIWidget`. This interface contains an extra `getItems` method which returns an array of `OCPDashboardModelWidgetItem` objects. ```
