!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! The last time the calendar is modified allows clients to optimize their requests. This method should return the corresponding unix timestamp. A fallback is to provide the value `null` as return value. This tells that the last modification time is not known at the moment. ```
<?php

function getLastModified() {
 return time();
}
