### Managing the access to the calendar -- IACL

The CalDAV defines some security relevant properties. These are implemented by means of `SabreDAVACLIACL`. The ACLs define who (in terms of principal uris) is allowed to do what on the calendar. Getting the owner of a calendar
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! The `getOwner` method gets the principal's uri. Here the stored value provided in the constructor is used. ```
