(Nextcloud 29.0.0)
Sometimes the processing of a the task may depend upon which user requested the task. You can now obtain this information in your provider by additionally implementing the `OCPSpeechToTextISpeechToTextProviderWithUserId` interface:

```
:emphasize-lines: 9,12,14,25,26,27

