Built-in task types often only specify the most basic input and output slots. If you would like to offer more input options
with your provider you can specify optional inputs and outputs using the `getOptionalInputShape` and `getOptionalOutputShape` methods. You will need to return an associative array of `OCPTaskProcessingShapeDescriptor` objects. ```
public function getOptionalInputShape(): array {
