 'input' => 'There was once a man with many cows who wanted to have even more cows.'
 ];
}
```
Note that you can only specify default values for 'Text' and 'Number' slots. The same works for your optional input shapes that you defined in `getOptionalInputShape`:

```
public function getOptionalInputShapeDefaults(): array {
